{"id":"b0e2f74fa0a4326a","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity.md","title":"三值透明性中的双条件恰在确定时取真","display":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 三值透明性中的双条件恰在确定时取真","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity","aliases":["91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity","91-prop-T-schema-restricted","91-prop-disquotation-conditional"],"display":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 三值透明性中的双条件恰在确定时取真","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity</span><span>91-prop-T-schema-restricted</span><span>91-prop-disquotation-conditional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 三值透明性中的双条件恰在确定时取真"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为一致固定点评估；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq v_X(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq v_X(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span> 在强 Kleene 评估中展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A\\lor B)\\land(\\neg B\\lor A)\">\\((\\neg A\\lor B)\\land(\\neg B\\lor A)\\)</span>，不使用一个未指定真值函数的额外联结词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi),\\qquad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi),\\\\\\mathbf u&amp;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi),\\qquad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi),\\\\\\mathbf u&amp;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个同值输入的双条件在 t、f 上取 t，在 u 上仍为 u；取指定值 {t} 时恰好确定情形满足。这个计算不给任何经典 KF 可证性判据。\n原稿的 J_SK 和带 SK 下标的双条件均未接到定义，现在复用规范固定点评估并展开实际运算。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.13；强 Kleene 真值函数的直接计算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq v_X(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"(\\neg A\\lor B)\\land(\\neg B\\lor A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi),\\qquad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&\\operatorname{Det}_X(\\varphi),\\\\\\mathbf u&v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity]]"}],"outgoing":["2bc1263010e83604","fcfe6f023ac58abf"]}